    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110-a2">

                <pb facs="0314" n="244" xml:id="pg244"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 7.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of the King to Mr.
                            Foote.</hi></head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I am pleased to receive the
                    gracious letter from His Excellency the President of the United States. I trust
                    that he is in good health. I am glad that he has sent you as the representative
                    of his Government, so far across the sea, to reside at my court. I rejoice that
                    the friendship of the two countries is now firmly cemented, and I am certain
                    that the friendly relations will always continue.</p>
            </div>
